bably wouldn't have  met if not for Hogwarts Legacy so many  of you would have never found this  channel if not for Hogwarts Legacy so I  just want to be clear to everyone  listening to this right now if I can get  a little sappy with you all for a bit  it's that I am so thankful I am super  thankful for every single one of you and  I hope you all have a fantastic holiday  season a season of Thanksgiving if you  celebrate the holiday and even if you  don't it's always great to reflect back  and be thankful and one of the things  that that I am so thankful for is the  Harry Potter fandom and so much of that  so much of my passion for this game is a  result of that it's a result of those  relationships and growing up and being a  fan of that series and just longing and  dreaming for this game and I just had to  put all of those thoughts in a video of  their own I'll link it here on the right  side of your screen now so definitely  check that one out next as always thank  you all so much for watching I'll talk  to you again soon
 

